"""Forward SDK chat session usage to AgentPulse's statusline endpoint.

Lifted verbatim from personal-assistant-dashboard. To be replaced by a
shared `agentpulse-client` package — see
`.tmp-gh-issue-agentpulse-shared.md`. The functions here are sync
(urllib-based); callers in async contexts should wrap them with
``asyncio.to_thread``.

Claude Agent SDK ``ResultMessage`` payloads are per-query, but
AgentPulse's ``/statusline/claude`` endpoint expects session-cumulative
totals in the same nested shape the Claude Code CLI's statusline hook
emits. ``SessionAccumulator`` sums per-query values across a session;
``build_payload`` produces the dict to POST; ``post_statusline`` does
the HTTP POST with errors swallowed so a down AgentPulse never breaks
the chat flow.
"""

from __future__ import annotations

